WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.300
Rokhlin's multiple mixing problem.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.457
Mixing makes two distant events independent. Rokhlin

3
00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:08.013
asked whether three or more must follow.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.122
Take the smallest failing order, simplify it,

5
00:00:11.122 --> 00:00:13.144
and show it cannot fail at all.

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.398
Claimed: yes, for every order.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.946
Checked in Lean.
